# do I wanna print another character?
    You're likely thinking of "Unicode" box-drawing characters — e.g., "┌┬┐├┼┤└┴┘─│" — which give much cleaner walls than plain ASCII plus/minus/pipe. Use Unicode box-drawing (or block) characters for borders and intersections, or heavy/rounded variants for different looks.
